# Qualcomm QCC730 Watchdog configuration options

config WATCHDOG_QCC730
	bool "Qualcomm QCC730 Watchdog driver"
	default y
	depends on WATCHDOG
	depends on DT_HAS_QCOM_QCC730_WATCHDOG_ENABLED
	help
	  Enable QCC730 watchdog driver support.
	  Always ensures all watchdog code is compiled.

config QWDT
	bool "Enable QWDT functionality"
	help
	  Enable actual QWDT (Qualcomm Watchdog) functionality.
	  
	  If enabled (y):
	    - Watchdog will be initialized and started
	    - Automatic feeding will be enabled
	    - PM callbacks will feed the watchdog
	    - All watchdog features are functional
	  
	  If disabled (n):
	    - Watchdog code is compiled but not functional
	    - All watchdog operations become no-ops
	    - Zero runtime overhead

